# Replicate

## Description

You need to design a recursive function called replicate which will receive arguments times and number.

The function should return an array containing the number repeated times times.
If times is 0, the function should return an empty array.

```ts
replicate(0, 5); // []
replicate(3, 5); // [5, 5, 5]
replicate(2, 1); // [1, 1]
replicate(5, 0); // [0, 0, 0, 0, 0]
```
